    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="6fd85852-1c03-53e0-9702-6366e28f18f9" activityNameId="1f698c87-8add-53b0-8acb-c0c6170e4d58" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Isohexane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Isohexane, at plant
The process "isohexane, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of isohexane from Hexane in Europe.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with literature data. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000096-14-0; 
Formula: C6H14O2; 
Synonyms: 2-methyl pentane; 
UUID: f02799e0-ceb1-3061-86a6-081f8bf59524
Production of isohexane including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Isomerization of n-hexane
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f02799e0-ceb1-3061-86a6-081f8bf59524.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
